    <description>Enhanced BMS46 partial 32KB XDF for M43TU. Based on Bms46_32kb_Galletto.xdf + BMS46_PARTIAL/FULL comparison. Renamed Oxygen Sensor tables 1-10, added MAF table converted to partial offset, and added map notes.</description>
